WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.720
It gets to be easy.

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.680
And I get to feel.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.540
All of it is welcome.

00:00:05.915 --> 00:00:08.855
At The Water Devotion,
you get to arrive

00:00:08.855 --> 00:00:11.015
and discover again:

00:00:11.015 --> 00:00:13.815
Here, in this moment,

00:00:13.815 --> 00:00:17.675
what is true for me?

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:20.445
Through movement,

00:00:20.495 --> 00:00:23.325
through expression, through dance,

00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:27.395
through moving our joints,

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:29.715
we keep discovering new layers

00:00:29.735 --> 00:00:33.645
to dance with, to try out,

00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:36.995
to explore and connect with.

00:00:37.318 --> 00:00:40.108
When you open yourself to

00:00:40.258 --> 00:00:42.608
working with me,

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.308
with The Water Devotion,

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:50.078
you can look forward to

00:00:50.118 --> 00:00:52.558
becoming

00:00:52.608 --> 00:00:55.258
strong in your softness.

00:00:55.602 --> 00:00:58.642
And to movement

00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.892
and fluidity

00:01:00.942 --> 00:01:05.142
becoming a natural

00:01:05.142 --> 00:01:07.692
devotion in everyday life.
